{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638/events","html_url":"https://github.com/rust-random/rand/issues/1638","id":3079776716,"node_id":"I_kwDOAc09Ts63kanM","number":1638,"title":"Missing `impl<T> Distribution<Option<T>> for StandardUniform where  StandardUniform: Distribution<T>` in 0.9","user":{"login":"JonathanWoollett-Light","id":16856679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODU2Njc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16856679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light","html_url":"https://github.com/JonathanWoollett-Light","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JonathanWoollett-Light/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":173092854,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMwOTI4NTQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/labels/X-bug","name":"X-bug","color":"bfbfbf","default":false,"description":"Type: bug report"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-21T10:42:19Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T10:49:31Z","closed_at":"2025-05-21T10:47:37Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\n[`StandardUniform`](https://docs.rs/rand/0.9.0/rand/distr/struct.StandardUniform.html) is missing the implementation for `Option<T>` that was previously present in 0.8 with [`impl<T> Distribution<Option<T>> for Standard where Standard: Distribution<T>`](https://docs.rs/rand/0.8.5/rand/distributions/struct.Standard.html#impl-Distribution%3COption%3CT%3E%3E).\n\nThis means when defining:\n```rust\nimpl Distribution<MyStruct> for StandardUniform {\n    // ...\n}\n```\nThen attempting:\n```rust\nlet x: Option<MyStruct> = rng.random();\n```\nYou will receive the error:\n```\nthe trait bound `StandardUniform: rand::distr::Distribution<std::option::Option<MyStruct>>` is not satisfied\n```\n\nThis seems like a big breaking change to miss, was this intentional?","closed_by":{"login":"dhardy","id":134893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDg5Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy","html_url":"https://github.com/dhardy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhardy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rust-random/rand/issues/1638/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}